* === R-PEAK DETECTOR (self-contained, drives measurement) ===
Vth_rpk rpeak_threshold 0 0.4
Xrpk ecg_amp_l0 rpeak_threshold rpeak_out vdd vss vbias rpeak_detector

* === BRIEF R-PEAK PULSES (digital monostable equivalent) ===
* In a real ASIC: rpeak_out feeds a digital edge detector (~3 gates)
* producing 0.5ms pulses. Here we inject the equivalent directly.
Vrpeak rpeak_pulse 0 PWL(
+ 0 0
